 ],
 "says": "A first user with no Team, no account, no provider connection and no repository opens the launcher on a fresh installation: reading the local profile (access.profile.read) returns the profile the runtime wrote at this first use, active at generation 1 because of first use and naming nothing but the local principal, and every later request runs at that generation. The user then creates a local principal from a device key on this laptop (identity.binding.add, established by local creation, no evidence from any provider), and the host is probed for reading what a start hands it. The launcher offers one qualified personal start route. The entry (surface.drive) shows the three personal positions checked and empty, the tool as a suggestion marked '(제안)', and one start action; there is no goal or task field. Tab and Enter dispatch one preparation.compose request whose basis is the personal scope alone with no source pins and no work_request; the owner stores a preparation, as the requester's own record with no receipt, of nothing selected whose task support is not requested, observed at a plain local folder, and route.select answers for that request with it. Negative: no step signs in, founds or selects a Team, binds a repository or reaches a provider; no answer carries a gap or recovery that asks for sign-in, a Team or a repository; and the missing intent is neither an error nor a guessed work_request.",
 "spec_sha256": "b56bbd72105d420289f32e290daf4f8bf543b52acabfaef4f89242f34efcd9de",
